OL,4,CTories would scrap Burnham's deal with 
OL,5,CEU, deputy leader says                 
OL,6,GConservative deputy leader Alex        
OL,7,GBurghart has said his party would      
OL,8,Gscrap the deal agreed between the UK   
OL,9,Gand the European Union on Friday, if   
OL,10,Gthe Tories win the next general        
OL,11,Gelection.                              
OL,13,FThe agreement signed by Prime Minister 
OL,14,FAndy Burnham covers a youth travel     
OL,15,Fscheme, emissions trading and British  
OL,16,Ffood exports.                          
OL,18,FThe government has argued scrapping    
OL,19,Fmost checks on British food exports    
OL,20,Fwill cut costs for businesses and      
OL,21,Fcould bring down prices for shoppers.  
